#: ../../docs/tools/scholarium/quickstart.md:1
#: 1d45e96a3b3b42378904f18549430dba
msgid "SecuredMe Scholarium quickstart"
msgstr "SecuredMe Scholarium inicio rapido"

#: ../../docs/tools/scholarium/quickstart.md:3
#: 0efe20be4c3645019289af150288fa9e
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "Requisitos"

#: ../../docs/tools/scholarium/quickstart.md:5
#: 55933d2086db419f8022410ddf07f9b7
msgid ""
"Use a clean checkout, the runtime declared by the repository, and its "
"committed lockfiles. Confirm the active branch before installing anything."
msgstr ""
"Use una copia limpia, el runtime declarado por el repositorio y sus archivos"
" de bloqueo confirmados. Confirme la rama activa antes de instalar nada."

#: ../../docs/tools/scholarium/quickstart.md:11
#: 22b89b33450648f28c53808266289edf
msgid "Install"
msgstr "Instalar"

#: ../../docs/tools/scholarium/quickstart.md:18
#: 33585419784443bcbe353929ce92f2fa
msgid "Start"
msgstr "Comenzar"

#: ../../docs/tools/scholarium/quickstart.md:24
#: bafd00c41af64ce39dc96679055bd7c9
msgid "Verify"
msgstr "Verificar"

#: ../../docs/tools/scholarium/quickstart.md:32
#: be36f7ee53ef4bd7badeb8efadbd32dd
msgid ""
"To inspect the adaptive side panel, load `companion/` as an unpacked "
"Manifest V3 extension in Chrome or Edge, open a supported SecuredMe "
"Education page, and use the extension action. Unknown pages are refused and "
"no host permission is requested."
msgstr ""
"To inspect the adaptive side panel, load `companion/` as an unpacked "
"Manifest V3 extension in Chrome or Edge, open a supported SecuredMe "
"Education page, and use the extension action. Unknown pages are refused and "
"no host permission is requested."

#: ../../docs/tools/scholarium/quickstart.md:34
#: 88b547cdcdef44d2bd60f8eb0842d537
msgid "Human acceptance"
msgstr "Aceptacion humana"

#: ../../docs/tools/scholarium/quickstart.md:36
#: 8d9fc86db3044220b8b3abda911c0b70
msgid ""
"Inspect the output, logs, test results, and diff. Accept, request a "
"correction, quarantine, or stop; do not silently promote a generated result."
msgstr ""
"Inspeccione la salida, los registros, los resultados de pruebas y el diff. "
"Acepte, solicite una correccion, ponga en cuarentena o detengase; no "
"promueva silenciosamente un resultado generado."
